@startuml
title Carpuncle Cloud / Lana-KI - MCP, Gateway und alle AI-Konten Flow
caption Stand: REDACTED technische Zielarchitektur. Keine Secrets, Tokens, Keys oder privaten URLs.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Admin / Thomas" as Admin
actor "Lana-KI\nOrchestrator" as Lana

cloud "Internet" as Internet
node "Cloudflare\nDNS / Tunnel / Zero Trust / Worker\n[REDACTED TOKENS]" as Cloudflare
node "Node A - Hetzner Edge\nGateway / MCP-Routing / Control Plane\nKeine Heavy-KI\nKeine Master-Secrets" as NodeA
node "Node B - Windows Primary Compute\nLM Studio 127.0.0.1:1234\nComfyUI 127.0.0.1:8188" as NodeB
node "Node C - RunPod\nBurst GPU / On-Demand Jobs" as NodeC
node "Node D - Debian Laptop\nAdmin / Monitoring / Relay\nLAN: [REDACTED_LAN_IP]" as NodeD
node "Node E - GCP\nExperimentelle Worker\nlana-ki-cloud-core / lana-490418" as NodeE
database "NAS / FritzBox\nVault / Cold Storage / Backups\noffline-first" as NAS

package "MCP / Repo-Kontext" as MCP {
  artifact "README.md" as README
  artifact "PROJECT_CONTEXT.md" as PROJECT_CONTEXT
  artifact "SECURITY.md" as SECURITY
  artifact "MCP.md" as MCPMD
  artifact ".mcp/repo.context.json" as REPOCTX
  artifact ".mcp/allowed-tools.json" as TOOLS
  artifact ".mcp/safety-policy.md" as SAFETY
}

package "GitHub Repos\ncarpu86/* / carpuapp/* / lana-ki-de/*" as GITHUB {
  component "Repo Context" as RepoContext
  component "Issues / PRs" as Issues
  component "Actions / Audits" as Actions
}

package "AI-Konten / Provider\nKeine Secret-Werte speichern" as AI {
  component "Local LM Studio" as LMStudio
  component "Local ComfyUI" as Comfy
  component "OpenAI / API\n[REDACTED]" as OpenAI
  component "Gemini / Google AI\n[REDACTED]" as Gemini
  component "Azure OpenAI\nUnbestätigt / optional" as AzureAI
  component "RunPod API\n[REDACTED]" as RunPodAPI
}

package "Notizbuch / Wissensablage" as NOTE {
  database "SharePoint\ncarpu.sharepoint.com\nLana_KI/Lana_Notizbuch" as SharePoint
  database "GitHub\ncarpu86/Lana_Notitzbuch.md" as GitNotebook
  database "Box.com\nNotizbuch-Spiegel\nUnbestätigt / manuell anzubinden" as Box
  database "Agent Builder\nGCP Sandbox/Core\nUnbestätigt / API-Connector offen" as AgentBuilder
}

Admin --> Lana : Auftrag / Audit / Freigabe
Lana --> SharePoint : schreibt Notizen / Architektur / Audit\nnur redigierte Daten
Lana --> GitNotebook : versioniert technische Doku\nkeine Secrets
Lana --> Box : optionaler Sync\nnur redigierte Kopien
Lana --> AgentBuilder : Kontext / Agenten-Konfiguration\nkeine Secrets

Internet --> Cloudflare : HTTPS / Gateway-Domain
Cloudflare --> NodeA : Tunnel / Worker / Zero Trust
NodeA --> MCP : liest Repo-Kontext / Tool-Policy
NodeA --> NodeB : routet lokale KI-Anfragen\nwenn erreichbar
NodeA --> NodeC : Burst-Fallback\nnur bei Bedarf
NodeA --> NodeE : experimentelle Worker\nbudgetlimitiert
NodeD --> NodeA : Admin / Monitoring
NodeD --> NodeB : Admin / Relay / Healthchecks
NodeB --> NAS : Backup / Restore / Medien / Logs\nnur sichere Pfade
SharePoint --> NAS : keine Runtime, nur Doku/Sync
GitNotebook --> MCP : MCP-Baseline und Audit-Stand

NodeB --> LMStudio : Text-Inferenz lokal
NodeB --> Comfy : Bild/Medien lokal
NodeC --> RunPodAPI : Heavy GPU Fallback
NodeE --> Gemini : GCP / Agent Tests
NodeA --> OpenAI : optional Provider-Routing\nnur via Vault/Env-Referenz
NodeA --> AzureAI : optional Fallback\nStatus unbestätigt

note right of SharePoint
Kanonisches Notizbuch:
Lana_KI/Lana_Notizbuch

Keine Secrets speichern.
end note

note bottom of NodeB
Local-First:
1. LM Studio lokal
2. ComfyUI lokal
3. erst dann Cloud/Burst
end note

note bottom of AI
Alle Keys/Tokens:
[REDACTED]
Nur Referenzen dokumentieren.
Rotation bei Leaks.
end note

@enduml
